eovpn-pro (1.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release version 1.5.0.
  * Scope NetworkManager operations to eOVPN-owned UUIDs and OpenVPN 3
    operations to one persisted session object path.
  * Add HTTPS-only, bounded configuration imports with private 0700/0600
    storage, duplicate/path/symlink checks, and transactional rollback.
  * Add explicit Secret Service credential save/clear controls and opt-in
    public IP lookup with bounded, validated responses.
  * Distinguish TCP-offline endpoints from unmeasured UDP endpoints.
  * Add GTK 4.6-compatible destructive confirmations and improved settings,
    challenge, status, accessibility, and privacy UX.
  * Migrate to the Flathub-compatible application ID
    io.github.Mahdi_Arts.eOVPN_Pro with legacy GSettings/keyring migration.
  * Add active CI quality gates, Debian package builds, Flatpak staging,
    security checks, and release checksums.
  * Correct upstream/contributor attribution and remove third-party flag/icon
    assets in favor of original artwork and Unicode country indicators.

 -- Mahdi Bagheban <info@MahdiArts.ir>  Sat, 22 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0330
